{{> menu id="about"}}

<section class="ui left aligned middle aligned segment">

  <h2>About the Parfume Collection App</h2>
  <p>
    More information about the Parfume Collection App and myself.
  </p>
   <p>
    I created this app as a project for my Web App Development class. I wanted to create an app that would allow users to keep track of their perfume collection and share it with others. I also wanted to learn more about Handlebars and how to use it to create dynamic web pages, This is just the first part as a lot of features are not introduced yet.
  </p>
<div class="ui cards">


{{#each emps}}  
  <div class="ui centered card">
    <div class="image">
      <img src="{{image}}">
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <a class="header">{{name}}</a>
      <div class="meta">
        <span class="date">Born in {{joined}}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="description">
        {{name}} is an {{job}} living in {{city}}.
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="extra content">
      <a>
        <i class="user icon"></i>
        {{mates}} Years Old
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
{{/each}}
</div>
</section>
